### Try the APIs from VS Code (REST Client extension) or Rider / Visual Studio.
### Start both services first:
###   dotnet run --project src/Inventory.Api      (http://localhost:5101)
###   dotnet run --project src/Orders.Api         (http://localhost:5102)

@orders = http://localhost:5102
@inventory = http://localhost:5101
@apiKey = dev-secret-key-change-me

### 1. Inventory (internal service - needs the API key)
GET {{inventory}}/api/inventory
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 2. Without the key -> 401 ProblemDetails (middleware short-circuit)
GET {{inventory}}/api/inventory

### 3. Create an order (idempotent: run it twice, you get the SAME order back)
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
X-Correlation-ID: my-trace-123

{
  "customerId": "cust-42",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-1001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "sku": "SKU-1002", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 4. Same key, different body -> 409 Conflict
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{ "customerId": "cust-42", "items": [ { "sku": "SKU-1001", "quantity": 9 } ] }

### 5. Out of stock -> 409, and the successful lines are released (saga compensation)
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-42",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-1001", "quantity": 1 },
    { "sku": "SKU-1004", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 6. Validation error -> 400 ProblemDetails
POST {{orders}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "", "items": [] }

### 7. List orders (paging + filter)
GET {{orders}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Confirmed

### 8. Cancel an order (replace the id) - stock is returned
DELETE {{orders}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 9. Diagnostics: circuit breaker state + background events processed
GET {{orders}}/api/v1/diagnostics

### ---- Resilience experiments ----

### 10. Make Inventory flaky: 70% failures + 300ms latency, then create orders and watch Orders' logs (retries -> circuit opens)
POST {{inventory}}/admin/chaos?failureRate=0.7&latencyMs=300
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 11. Heal it
POST {{inventory}}/admin/chaos?failureRate=0&latencyMs=0
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
